  (text "Shunt chain: force node -> 1 R -> 100 R -> sense node, with bypass FETs"
    (at 16.51 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "abf2c019-3004-44ce-a075-dce09131d455")
  )
  (text "R401 + R402: 30 mA and 300 uA ranges.\nQ401 / Q402 short them for the 3 A range.\nD401 / D402 (BAV199, 5 nA leakage) cap\nthe burden at ~0.6 V per shunt while\nranging up.  C401: <= 1 uF after the shunts."
    (at 147.32 45.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "0bb22e88-30ea-442e-a508-163852ba1394")
  )
  (text "Range sense amplifiers (INA190A3, gain 100, 30 mV full scale)"
    (at 16.51 137.16 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "20800207-a1b1-415d-ba57-232401abc201")
  )
  (text "I_30MA: 30 mA -> 3.0 V (8 uA/LSB @ 12 bit).  I_300UA: 300 uA -> 3.0 V (80 nA/LSB).\nRange-up in hardware: COMP1 (I_300UA) / COMP2 (I_30MA) trip the TIM1 / TIM8 break\n-> RANGE_B / RANGE_A latch high within ~1 us; firmware ranges down with hysteresis."
    (at 20.32 250.19 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "701fbd97-4800-47b5-884d-2e2fd6e23d16")
  )
  (text "Isolated gate-drive island (reference = VFORCE)"
    (at 217.17 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "6207bc8f-d94e-493c-a1c3-dbc81472a79c")
  )
  (text "The island floats at the force node, so the bypass FETs get VGS = 5 V at any output voltage.\nCA-IS3720HS (suffix H): outputs default HIGH while the MCU does not drive RANGE_A/B (reset)\n-> both bypass FETs on -> highest range (lowest burden).  R412/R413 make that explicit.\nR411: B0505S needs >= 20 mA (10 %) load; the island draws ~8 mA, R411 adds 15 mA.\nKeep the island compact; no copper of other nets under PS401 / U404 (isolation).\nRange bypass: RANGE_A -> Q401 (1 R), RANGE_B -> Q402 (100 R)."
    (at 220.98 182.88 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "23f43691-bcc1-454f-a402-7cf920db7bdd")
  )
